# Pyramid Mesh
# Unit scale: Centered at (0, 0, 0)

# 1. Vertices (x, y, z)
v -1.0 -1.0 -1.0  # 1: Bottom-Left-Back
v  1.0 -1.0 -1.0  # 2: Bottom-Right-Back
v  1.0 -1.0  1.0  # 3: Bottom-Right-Front
v -1.0 -1.0  1.0  # 4: Bottom-Left-Front
v  0.0  1.0  0.0  # 5: Top Apex

# 2. Triangular Faces (1-indexed vertex IDs)
#f 1 2 5           # Back side face
#f 2 3 5           # Right side face
f 3 4 5           # Front side face
#f 4 1 5           # Left side face
#f 1 3 2           # Base floor (Triangle A)
#f 1 4 3           # Base floor (Triangle B)